{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Also to all.</b> He says to the wise man: if you wish to find rest, do not set your heart upon all the words of men — even if one curses you, and even your servant. For if you set your heart upon their words, you will become angry, and the light of the soul's wisdom will grow dim."], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:28:10.363907419Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}